# SPRAG Conventions

- Route server logic belongs in `app/routes/**/server.py`.
- Browser UI and behavior belong in `web.py`, `components.py`, and `modules.py`.
- Use `Controller.load()` for route data and `@action` for mutations.
- Use `self.call_action("action_name", payload)` from browser `Module` classes.
- Return `ui.*` nodes from `Screen.render()` and `Component.render()`.
- Use `store("name", initial={...})` for shared state.
- Use `emit_socket_refetch(...)` when the client should refetch authoritative action state.
- Do not call browser-only APIs from server-side Python.
